OL,3,GNEWSAWeak and immature management
OL,4,Aputting patients at risk at failing
OL,5,Ahealth board, review finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe largest health board in Wales is
OL,8,Fstill failing, with "fundamental
OL,9,Fweaknesses" in its governance and
OL,10,Fmanagement, according to a new report.
OL,12,FBetsi Cadwaladr University Health Board
OL,13,F(BCUHB) has been in special measures
OL,14,Ffor around half its existence, with the
OL,15,Flatest period starting in 2023.
OL,17,FA review of its leadership published on
OL,18,FTuesday found that, in some parts of
OL,19,Fthe health board, targets and money
OL,20,F"have a greater priority for senior
OL,21,Fmanagement than the quality and safety
OL,22,Fof care".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
