OL,3,GNEWSAWeak and immature management
OL,4,Aputting patients at risk at failing
OL,5,Ahealth board, review finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the report does not suggest
OL,8,Fbreaking BCUHB up into smaller
OL,9,Forganisations, saying it has committed
OL,10,Fand loyal staff and is able to deliver
OL,11,Fsome strong local services.
